      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think having the option to *NOT* show my avatar to none friends would be useful a way of slowing or stagnating the ripping scene. \n\nI don't think anything is lost in terms of this as if I wanted you to see a default avatar I would use a default avatar. Nothing creative is being blocked other than for myself. \n\nI do believe there are other ways better than this idea though but I do like the option for this also.",
