      "value": "@{62df0f025ab68c44b7d4e5ef|full_name}: And you can't access any of them without \"earning\" credits by stealing even more avatars from other users. So get out of here with that \"archive\" bullshit they try to disguise their operation as. No one with half a brain or a fragment of a moral compass is falling for it.\n\nEdit: Based on your other comments you seem abnormally interested in actively defending/dismissing the act of ripping, and openly confirmed having used the site. Both this mindset and the implication you may well be a ripper yourself, is more than enough to justify blocking you.",
