      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be a nice option to have. if people don't like to have their personal avatar show, just have a fall-back. Doesn't have to be the Quest-like fallback, but a selected fallback.\n\nAdded.\n\nThere are plenty of events going on in VRChat. Some people or event organisers might not have a strong PC. So meanwhile people can use their own Avatar while maintaining good FPS for others.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
