      "value": "@{600b668c6a46514dbb4e5c49|full_name}: Non-friends already don't get my files, and no one has ever blocked me for that.\n\nSo it's not about whether you can see an avi or not. It's about whether you are aware of it.\n\nI think the devs should let us select an avatar to be used for non-friends, so that they won't suspect a thing.",
