      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yet you can still experience the person, their voice and personality. You can have fun and connect with them.\n\nYou won't be seeing a low-poly fallback. You'll see an avatar they chose and like. It may not be their own exact sona/avatar, but it's something that still represents them.",
