      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64524c2aeaa25d33b64617e5|full_name}: this. There's so many people saying it's a bad decision as if something bad would happen to them. A lot of people who put a lot of work on their avatars would love to have this feature, it's like if they didn't want them to have the chance to protect their work. \n\nSomeone finds a simple way to make theft harder and people are against it for no reason, because \"i won't see your avatar\" is not an excuse, not everyone wants you to see their avatar and there's no reason why they should show their avatar to you. If you really are so desperate to load their avatar, they'll just assume you want to rip it.\n\nJust let people have the chance to have something good, it does 0 harm to you and it helps other people a lot",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
